# Elesh Norn, Mother of Machines: "If a permanent entering causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to
# trigger, that ability triggers an additional time" (CR 603.2d) and "Permanents entering don't cause abilities of
# permanents your opponents control to trigger" (CR 603.2). Bot1 casts Elesh Norn on turn 1, then a Baleful Strix: its
# "When this creature enters, draw a card" triggers twice - two separate triggers to order and put on the stack - and
# Bot1 draws two. On turn 2 Bot2's own Strix enters under Elesh Norn and its ability does not trigger at all: Bot2 draws
# nothing.
# Bot1's hand: 7, all cast on turn 1, then the two draws: 2. Bot2's: 7 + 1 drawn on turn 2 - 3 cast = 5.

